TEXT -88 32 Left 2 ;You can see that with phase regulation (parameter s_ of the transformer)\nyou can change the active power flow between the two cables\nThe phase angle is determined by the parameters phir and phii\nin this case -120 degrees phir = -0.5 and  phii = -0.866025404\n \nExercise: Plot the powerlost of the two lines+transformers \nand see at which taping of the s_ parameter the powerlost is\nminimized
